{"title": "Eilistraee", "pageid": 19337, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Eilistraee", "categories": ["Gods"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Eilistraee</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"title\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Dark Maiden<br>Lady Silverhair</div>\n</div><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Sticker_Deities_Eilistraee.webp\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Sticker Deities Eilistraee.webp\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Sticker_Deities_Eilistraee.webp/300px-Sticker_Deities_Eilistraee.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Sticker_Deities_Eilistraee.webp/300px-Sticker_Deities_Eilistraee.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Sticker_Deities_Eilistraee.webp/600px-Sticker_Deities_Eilistraee.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Sticker Deities Eilistraee.webp\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"family\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Family</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lolth\" title=\"Lolth\">Lolth</a> (mother)<br><a href=\"/wiki/Corellon_Larethian\" title=\"Corellon Larethian\">Corellon Larethian</a> (father)</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deity\">Deity</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Eilistraee</b> is the drow <a href=\"/wiki/Deities\" title=\"Deities\">goddess</a> of beauty and freedom, chaotic good. She is associated with the domains <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Domain\" title=\"Life Domain\">Life</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Domain\" title=\"Light Domain\">Light</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Nature_Domain\" title=\"Nature Domain\">Nature</a>.\n\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 80px; height: 80px; clip-path: xywh(0 0 100% 100% round 15%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_M_Image.png/80px-Book_Tome_M_Image.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_M_Image.png/120px-Book_Tome_M_Image.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_M_Image.png/160px-Book_Tome_M_Image.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Book_Tome_M_Image.png/80px-Book_Tome_M_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Book_Tome_M_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">No wonder Eillistraee smiled and wept with equal fierceness when she defeated her mother.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Eilistraee:_Lady_Silverhair\" title=\"Eilistraee: Lady Silverhair\">Eilistraee: Lady Silverhair</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Eilistraee<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> is the goddess of beauty, song, and freedom. She is primarily worshipped by <a href=\"/wiki/Seldarine_Drow\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Seldarine Drow\">Drow</a> who abandoned her mother <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lolth\" title=\"Lolth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/15px-Lolth_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/23px-Lolth_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/31px-Lolth_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lolth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp/15px-Lolth_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Lolth_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lolth\" title=\"Lolth\">Lolth</a> in favor of the Dark Maiden, who desires balance between all races, and struggles against her mother Lolth's corrupt aims. \n</p><p>This deity can be selected by player <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">Clerics</a> except <a href=\"/wiki/Lolth-sworn_Drow\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lolth-sworn Drow\">Lolth-sworn Drow</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Blessings\">Blessings</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phalar_Aluve:_Melody\" title=\"Phalar Aluve: Melody\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Phalar_Aluve_Melody_Icon.webp/25px-Phalar_Aluve_Melody_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Phalar_Aluve_Melody_Icon.webp/38px-Phalar_Aluve_Melody_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Phalar_Aluve_Melody_Icon.webp/50px-Phalar_Aluve_Melody_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phalar Aluve: Melody\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Phalar_Aluve_Melody_Icon.webp/25px-Phalar_Aluve_Melody_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Phalar_Aluve_Melody_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phalar_Aluve:_Melody\" title=\"Phalar Aluve: Melody\">Phalar Aluve: Melody</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phalar_Aluve:_Sing\" title=\"Phalar Aluve: Sing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Phalar_Aluve_Sing_Icon.webp/25px-Phalar_Aluve_Sing_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Phalar_Aluve_Sing_Icon.webp/38px-Phalar_Aluve_Sing_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Phalar_Aluve_Sing_Icon.webp/50px-Phalar_Aluve_Sing_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phalar Aluve: Sing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Phalar_Aluve_Sing_Icon.webp/25px-Phalar_Aluve_Sing_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Phalar_Aluve_Sing_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phalar_Aluve:_Sing\" title=\"Phalar Aluve: Sing\">Phalar Aluve: Sing</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phalar_Aluve:_Shriek\" title=\"Phalar Aluve: Shriek\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Phalar_Aluve_Shriek_Icon.webp/25px-Phalar_Aluve_Shriek_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Phalar_Aluve_Shriek_Icon.webp/38px-Phalar_Aluve_Shriek_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Phalar_Aluve_Shriek_Icon.webp/50px-Phalar_Aluve_Shriek_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phalar Aluve: Shriek\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Phalar_Aluve_Shriek_Icon.webp/25px-Phalar_Aluve_Shriek_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Phalar_Aluve_Shriek_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></s